config E1000
    tristate "Intel PRO/1000 (8254x, QEMU and VMware e1000)"
    default y
    help
      Native PCI Ethernet driver. With M, build e1000.ko for this ReliefNT
      kernel. Device registration, DMA STOP and callback drain use the same
      entry points for builtin and loadable configurations.
